  m_text: '       Modulator/Power Amplifier 2-MODPA2(Standby)

    MODPA modulates
    and amplifies the CSB and SBO signals for the standby channel. It monitors and
    measures output and reflected power. Also includes 3 main circuits: CSB modulator,
    SBO modulator & linear power amplifier.'
